istered with LaunchServices, takes the extension's place (PlugInKit -10819) - unregister and delete it, then pluginkit -a the current appex; the extension's log is in vpn-service-config/. MacShim: its run and stop can be scripted through Xcode's AppleScript (seen with the SPA sample, 2026-11-01)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"vpnhood/VpnHood","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:46:00Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"1c323ef621ef5e8529acc3907d7d3fc22d380523","github_link":"https://github.com/vpnhood/VpnHood/commit/1c323ef621ef5e8529acc3907d7d3fc22d380523","commit_subject":"iOS web view host: the app's window opens. UIKit refused IosWebViewSceneDelegate (\"delegateClass must conform to UISceneDelegate protocol\"): a subclass of the model class UIWindowSceneDelegate registers without declaring the protocol, so a head on the host showed no window, and the VPN approval, an alert over it, never came. It is a UIResponder implementing IUIWindowSceneDelegate now, its members exported, as Avalonia's scene delegate is. The SPA sample on the Mac, given a delegate of this shape (its packages are 9.0.856), opens its window and connects","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"microsoft/MIDI","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:45:54Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"f00bad496c50e511629656df12e5bbef882acc87","github_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/MIDI/commit/f00bad496c50e511629656df12e5bbef882acc87","commit_subject":"Sequencer: Copy chords to new track, and key signatures in Standard MIDI Files","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"pymedphys/pymedphys","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:45:29Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"675f69886b4dcceca42883a0cabef0033dddbbe9","github_link":"https://github.com/pymedphys/pymedphys/commit/675f69886b4dcceca42883a0cabef0033dddbbe9","commit_subject":"Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into claude/project-thread-q6jl9x","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"GMOD/jbrowse-components","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:45:27Z","branch":"main","commit_s